      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "patient notifcation service. \ninternal API\n\ntake payload → message patient via SMS?\n\n1. transactional. youre order is ready\n2. marketing messages\n\ninterface\npatient id\nnotification type\npayload\n\npatient preferences\n- channel choice\n- opt out\n- notif type\n- quiet hours\n\navoid spam\n- dedup \"similar\" messages",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "patient notifcation service. \ninternal API\n\ntake payload → message patient via SMS?\n\n1. transactional. youre order is ready\n2. marketing messages\n\ninterface\npatient id\nnotification type\npayload\n\npatient preferences\n- channel choice\n- opt out\n- notif type\n- quiet hours\n\navoid spam\n- dedup \"similar\" messages",
