      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "workload\n500k / day\n\n\n\n- accept a request\n- select channel per patient pref and notif type\n- enforce opt outs per type\n- enforce quiet hours\n- dedup\n\n\nTransational messages\n- timeliness\n\nmarketing\n- spam avoidance\n\nfor both:\n- dedupe\n- opt out\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "workload\n500k / day\n\n\n\n- accept a request\n- select channel per patient pref and notif type\n- enforce opt outs per type\n- enforce quiet hours\n- dedup\n\n\nTransational messages\n- timeliness\n\nmarketing\n- spam avoidance\n\nfor both:\n- dedupe\n- opt out\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
